 Surg 87(6):855–863 [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 19. Fenner D, Probst P, Klasen JM, Antony P, Hauswirth F, Muller MK (2023) Career goals of surgeons in Switzerland. Langenbecks Arch Surg 408(1):361 [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 20. Guiab K, Evans T, Brigode W, Stamelos G, Sebekos K, Siddiqi M et al (2022) Complications after inpatient laparoscopic cholecystectomy: effect of surgeon experience, procedure volume, and other surgeon-based characteristics. Am Surg 88(8):1798–1804 [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 21. Chatha HN, Pawar O, Boutros C, Khan SZ, Wieland P, Levine I et al (2024) Does practice make perfect? Studying the relationship between surgeon experience and patient outcomes for paraesophageal hernia repairs. Surg Endosc 38(10):6017–6025 [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 22. Yuval JB, Thompson HM, Verheij FS, Fiasconaro M, Patil S, Widmar M et al (2023) Comparison of robotic, laparoscopic, and open resections of nonmetastatic colon cancer. Dis Colon Rectum 66(10):1347–1358 [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 23. Krieg A, Kolbe EW, Kaspari M, Krieg S, Loosen SH, Roderburg C et al (2024) Trends and outcomes in colorectal cancer surgery: a multicenter cross-sectional study of minimally invasive versus open techniques in Germany. Surg Endosc 38(11):6338–6346 [ DOI ] [ PMC free article ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 24. Affairs FDoH. Zulassungssteuerung von Ärztinnen und Ärzten: Umsetzung des revidierten KVG-Art. 55a: Federal Department of Home Affairs (2023) [Available from: https://www.fmh.ch/dienstleistungen/recht/zulassungsrecht.cfm 25. Basel-Stadt K (2025) Bewilligungen für Arztberufe: Kanton Basel-Stadt; [Available from: https://www.bs.ch/themen/arbeit-und-steuern/arbeitsbewilligungen/medizinische-berufe/universitaere-medizinalberufe/bewilligungen-fuer-arztberufe Associated Data This section collects any data citations, data availability statements, or supplementary materials included in this article. Data A